; Regression test for issue #3261: between two named commodities, a one
; to one C directive reports amounts of a unit or more in the commodity
; written on its left, which the directive's order decides and the
; postings' order does not.  A side without a commodity is rejected
; instead (see 3261.test).

C 1 EUR = 1 USD
C 1 CHF = 1 GBP

2021-01-01 Euros against dollars
    A               10 EUR
    B              -10 USD

2021-01-01 Pounds against francs
    C               10 GBP
    D              -10 CHF

test bal
              10 EUR  A
             -10 EUR  B
              10 CHF  C
             -10 CHF  D
--------------------
                   0
end test
